gpt-toolkit (3.0.0-1) jammy; urgency=medium

  [Tyler Adams]
  * BREAKING: Simplified to single gpt executable
  * Remove gpt-extract-code, gpt-to-substack, gpt-token-length utilities
  * Add --tokens flag to gpt for token counting (outputs JSON)
  * JSON output includes token_count, token_ids, and model
  * Major version bump due to removed commands

